{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:935e2e03b18b9ddf1ae039f872e878d5ae592d8742cb76fc2d04e951d424be22",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b249ff3c3b9c8817c6ad8ce82817406c7df15c5a8dcdf33b31dd2f45eaa3e92",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー？\n听你声音的动静，还在工作中吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eac45b6855021e10962477f5af1f545f3e25f3d1397bf8a1a1c5c53306cfe0cc",
      "text": "没关系的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:778778f16847d82c1f7dd6095c1d15fde4c706c0eea4d7fcf83c7725cb554a62",
      "text": "那就好。\n突然又想跟你聊聊音乐节的事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:367d062344daf91a4be352f76b7b377ff2c233a95f86599ae98206c8d3c40eb4",
      "text": "毕竟是315 Production全员出演的音乐节啊。\n你这家伙各种事情忙得不可开交吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9104c8d569a3473932b454a8d7964c4c2f6943a3b86127b19073d3e301aa4c4",
      "text": "能够以成功告终，\n毫无疑问全多亏了你。辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d7b205c0c4b765651c0cf376ad144556ee9065233692c98e77d8351a2f90090",
      "text": "话说回来真是一场好演出啊。演出结束后\n连扫除都无从下手，干净得无可挑剔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f602f82d05aba7065bf75f6c8ce9edf772bdc8bbc3eb4379e79cc3c99d4705",
      "text": "虽然有些家伙看起来很紧张，\n但表现都很亮眼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b8eeca7afa224711afed6bb82806a77b6b03fb88df72e352dc90715a15aaea2",
      "text": "那时候你紧张了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2251ff9d9e2e6dc8bb59c09286a6e8bf9a99faca0a304d0fe4b22d296a322e47",
      "text": "哈哈，谁知道呢。\n如你亲眼所见咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_401_2_4_044_01_09_a:2_4_044_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b1f3aa1dd179ce7742eb462ec2928ce274f6c1000aeb4321dd6f90d9ce22f4",
      "text": "说起来，你还在工作中呢。\n这事留到下次再聊吧。挂了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
